full-query: "A gaming company wants to migrate their on-premises MySQL database to Google Cloud. They need a solution that ensures minimal downtime, can handle schema changes during the migration process, and provides data validation and rollback capabilities. They also want to migrate their data to a globally distributed and scalable managed database service. Which combination of the following Google Cloud database migration tools and managed database services is most appropriate for this scenario?"
