  "originalOptions": "A. Database Migration Service (DMS) and Cloud Spanner<br/>B. Database Migration Service (DMS) and Cloud Bigtable<br/>C. Cloud Dataflow and Firestore<br/>D. Database Migration Service (DMS) and Cloud SQL for MySQL",
